ership, seeds, architecture/optimizer policy or bars. Actual H-c readiness/data retention remain separate mandatory evidence.\",\n    \"Resource exhaustion or timeout is a genuine refusal/failure, not authority to reduce work, select another seed, lower a bar or interpret partial output as qualification. Prior failed CPU55 and missing original closings remain literal.\",\n    \"PPO300 was an explicitly authorized finite experiment following observed failures; H-c adds no allocation change. Adaptive history, no proven causal repair and no success guarantee remain disclosed. California100 and other allocations stay fixed.\",\n    \"External bars remain fixed independent comparators; project-calibrated compact-proxy slacks retain their limitations. This review does not promote them to published-model parity, population confidence or an unseen-test claim.\"\n  ],\n  \"supervised_reasoning\": {\n    \"path\": \"/Users/matthewnowak/jitML/.build/phase278-stateful-pv-fix-20261101-a/criterion-review-hc-drafts-a/supervised-math-draft.json\",\n    \"bytes\": 6252,\n    \"sha256\": \"399506c396b13ab2188d59a5cf789402f2441bc0470e9cb756f510c845fd64bc\"\n  },\n  \"independent_native_reasoning_draft\": {\n    \"path\": \"/Users/matthewnowak/jitML/.build/phase278-stateful-pv-fix-20261101-a/criterion-review-hc-drafts-a/independent-native-draft.json\",\n    \"bytes\": 16188,\n    \"sha256\": \"ec1594f41e284a21dfa53089989fe69d36b75afb73e9fda26999fa807d27d3a5\"\n  },\n  \"unchanged_restrictions\": [\n    \"Exactly five original prescribed complete members in canonical order; retain finite failures.\",\n    \"At least three SAME original members jointly meet every relevant strict own-initial and fixed reference/signal predicate.\",\n    \"Whole-five statistic remains additional; authentic original served index0 independently meets learning/reference/quality.\",\n    \"Original complete work, source/device/physical artifact, exact replay/Store/portable qualification/journal/typed admission