    "literal_utf8": "{\n  \"format\": \"jitml-current-hc-independent-principal-four-scope-assessment-v1\",\n  \"reviewer\": \"Codex /root/resource_resume_review/vit_driver_api_review\",\n  \"reviewed_utc\": \"2026-11-01T15:48:04.696926+00:00\",\n  \"reviewer_role_and_authorship\": \"I am the distinct current principal assessor of the four authored V2 judgments, separate from their author /root/resource_resume_review, the distinct peer /root/cpu55_resource_review_g and mechanical operator Root. I authored the earlier ignored conditional independent-native-draft and criterion-invariance audit and ignored resource/recovery/RTS/continuation preparations, and reviewed orchestration. I do not claim an independent audit of my own artifacts or author-independent implementation approval. I did not author the current four V2 judgments, native/supervised scientific policy or approved PPO300/California100 changes. My current judgment uses independently read source, actual current export/provenance, fresh arithmetic and exact current authored bytes; self-authored support is disclosed context only. No human signoff is asserted.\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"algorithm\": 1,\n    \"sha256\": \"9b407084744b68cf5ae2dd89ca1125555f7df5d2f382c8246ec33c9925f464ac\"\n  },\n  \"source_files\": 617,\n  \"draft_preparation\": {\n    \"path\": \"/Users/matthewnowak/jitML/.build/phase278-stateful-pv-fix-20261101-a/criterion-review-hc-drafts-a/actual-export-bound-v2/draft-preparation.json\",\n    \"bytes\": 3006,\n    \"sha256\": \"7f5b9cf83b516bc40e3df3deee10bcf007d048152b4b3636f62f5a1ae9f88691\"\n  },\n  \"draft_manifest\": {\n    \"path\": \"/Users/matthewnowak/jitML/.build/phase278-stateful-pv-fix-20261101-a/criterion-review-hc-drafts-a/actual-export-bound-v2/draft-manifest-not-authorized.json\",\n    \"bytes\": 90141,\n    \"sha256\": \"0789a02b8666740b1de7cf233afc37e1c6ea8c23ad854aec3f96c4a5cd34dd72\"\n  },\n  \"scope_decisions\": [\n    {\n      \"lane\": \"linux-cpu\",\n      \"scope\": \"